# Ownership boundaries for the shared-memory program (IMP-003).
#
# Roles are from `artifacts/21-implementation-backlog.md` §10.2. Until the
# program has named humans for each role, the repository owner stands in for
# every one of them — the point of this file today is that a change to a
# contract cannot be merged without the domain owner seeing it.
#
# Later patterns win, so the most specific rule for a path is the last one.

*                                               @starryark

